OL,3,AMore than half of Israeli votes counted
OL,4,Aas Netanyahu and Eisenkot both set to
OL,5,Afall short of majority
OL,6,
OL,7,FWith more than half the votes counted,
OL,8,FIsrael's election result is far from
OL,9,Fcertain and neither of the two main
OL,10,Fblocs are on track to reach a majority
OL,11,Fin the Knesset
OL,13,FEisenkot leads the newly formed Yashar
OL,14,Fparty and is the main figure in the
OL,15,F"change bloc", a group of opposition
OL,16,Fparties aiming to oust Netanyahu. Exit
OL,17,Fpolls suggest Netanyahu's Likud is set
OL,18,Fto be the biggest single party in
OL,19,Fparliament
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
